# You design and build LEGO Technic models one step at a time, in a build language.
#
# For each step you write:
# ADD name partnumber color
# CONNECT part.point -> part.point LOCKED|TURNS|STIFF   (points: hole1.., axlehole1.., pin1.., axle1.., clip1..; LOCKED = cross in cross, turn together; TURNS = free; STIFF = friction pin)
# Optional: MESH a.teeth b.teeth / RATIO a b x/y / GROUP g (opens a side build) / END (closes it) / ATTACH g (joins a finished side build into the main model)
# WHY one plain sentence: what this step builds and what it is for.
# A point ending in ~ is an estimate; ? means not known.
#
# Rules: only use real points of each part; a round pin never goes in a cross hole; a shaft that must turn needs round holes; a worm needs stops on both sides; gears must sit at the right distance.
STEP 1
ADD beam11-1 32009 white
ADD pin-1 43093 blue
ADD pin-2 42924 blue
ADD pin-3 42924 blue
ADD pin-4 43093 blue
CONNECT pin-2.pin1 -> beam11-1.hole1 STIFF
CONNECT pin-3.pin1 -> beam11-1.hole3 STIFF
WHY Starts the right-hand side rail and gives it its first two mounting pins.

STEP 2
ADD beam3x5-1 32526 black
ADD pin-5 42924 blue
ADD pin-6 42924 blue
ADD beam2x4-1 32140 white
CONNECT pin-5.pin2 -> beam3x5-1.hole7 STIFF
CONNECT pin-6.pin2 -> beam3x5-1.hole6 STIFF
CONNECT pin-1.axle1 -> beam3x5-1.hole4 TURNS
CONNECT pin-2.pin2 -> beam3x5-1.hole3 STIFF
CONNECT pin-3.pin2 -> beam3x5-1.hole1 STIFF
CONNECT pin-5.pin1 -> beam2x4-1.hole2 STIFF
CONNECT pin-6.pin1 -> beam2x4-1.hole1 STIFF
WHY Turns the single beam into an L, starting the front corner of the frame.

STEP 3
ADD pin-7 11214 red
ADD conn-1 63869 lightgray
ADD pin-8 4274 lightgray
ADD pin-9 4274 lightgray
ADD pin-10 4274 lightgray
CONNECT pin-8.pin1 -> conn-1.hole1 TURNS
CONNECT pin-9.pin1 -> conn-1.hole2 TURNS
CONNECT pin-10.pin1 -> conn-1.hole3 TURNS
CONNECT pin-7.pin1 -> beam2x4-1.hole3 STIFF
WHY Adds a cosmetic engine-fan detail to the body front.

STEP 4
ADD pin-11 42924 blue
ADD panel-1 24116 blue
ADD beam2x4-2 32140 white
ADD pin-12 2780 black
CONNECT pin-11.pin2 -> panel-1.hole1 STIFF
CONNECT pin-11.pin3 -> beam2x4-2.hole4 STIFF
CONNECT pin-12.pin1 -> beam2x4-2.hole3 STIFF
CONNECT pin-5.pin3 -> beam2x4-2.hole2 STIFF
CONNECT pin-6.pin3 -> beam2x4-2.hole1 STIFF
CONNECT pin-11.pin1 -> beam2x4-1.hole4 STIFF
WHY Adds the left front upright, so the frame is no longer one-sided, and closes the gap between the two uprights with a panel.

STEP 5
ADD pin-13 18651 black
ADD beam2x4-3 32140 white
ADD pin-14 42924 blue
CONNECT pin-13.axle2 -> beam2x4-3.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT pin-14.pin2 -> beam2x4-3.hole3 STIFF
CONNECT pin-13.axle1 -> beam11-1.hole4 TURNS
WHY Starts the engine-deck section behind the cab, stepping the frame back from the front box.

STEP 6
ADD beam2x4-4 32140 white
ADD pin-15 65489 lightgray
ADD axle3-1 24316 brown
ADD gear12-1 32270 black
ADD conn-2 59443 red
ADD pin-16 43093 blue
CONNECT pin-15.pin3 -> beam2x4-4.hole1 STIFF
CONNECT pin-15.pin4 -> beam2x4-4.hole3 STIFF
CONNECT pin-14.pin1 -> beam2x4-4.hole4 STIFF
CONNECT axle3-1.axle3 -> pin-15.hole3 TURNS
CONNECT axle3-1.axle2 -> gear12-1.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT axle3-1.axle1 -> conn-2.axlehole1 LOCKED
WHY Closes the engine deck and starts the control gear train inside it.

STEP 7
ADD beam3x3-1 60484 red
ADD pin-17 44874 red
ADD pin-18 3749 tan
ADD conn-3 59443 red
CONNECT pin-4.axle1 -> beam3x3-1.hole4 TURNS
CONNECT pin-16.axle1 -> beam3x3-1.hole3 TURNS
CONNECT pin-18.axle1 -> pin-17.hole1 TURNS
CONNECT pin-17.pin1 -> beam11-1.hole6 STIFF
WHY Adds the outer bearing point the worm gear's shaft will spin in, opposite pin-15.

STEP 8
ADD axle4-1 3705 black
ADD worm-1 27938 darkgray
ADD gear20-1 18575 tan
CONNECT axle4-1.axle3 -> worm-1.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT axle4-1.axle1 -> gear20-1.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT axle4-1.axle2 -> pin-15.hole1 TURNS
CONNECT axle4-1.axle4 -> conn-3.axlehole2 LOCKED
WHY Fits the worm gear and the first driven gear onto the same shaft, next to the gear train built in step 6.

STEP 9
ADD beam2x4-5 32140 white
ADD pin-19 43093 blue
ADD pin-20 2780 black
ADD beam11-2 32009 white
ADD pin-21 43093 blue
CONNECT pin-20.pin1 -> beam2x4-5.hole2 STIFF
CONNECT pin-14.pin3 -> beam2x4-5.hole4 STIFF
CONNECT pin-15.pin1 -> beam2x4-5.hole1 STIFF
CONNECT pin-15.pin2 -> beam2x4-5.hole3 STIFF
CONNECT pin-2.pin3 -> beam11-2.hole1 STIFF
CONNECT pin-3.pin3 -> beam11-2.hole3 STIFF
CONNECT pin-13.pin1 -> beam11-2.hole4 STIFF
CONNECT pin-17.pin2 -> beam11-2.hole6 STIFF
