STEP 12
GROUP side1
ADD conn-4 42003 red
ADD pin-27 2780 black
ADD pin-28 2780 black
ADD panel-2 11947 red
ADD axle3-2 4519 yellow
CONNECT pin-27.pin2 -> conn-4.hole1 STIFF
CONNECT pin-28.pin2 -> conn-4.hole2 STIFF
