STEP 14
ATTACH side1
CONNECT pin-30.pin2 -> beam2x4-4.hole2 STIFF
WHY Fits the finished right-side fairing onto the frame in one motion.

STEP 15
ADD axle6-1 3706 red
ADD bush-1 99021 darkgray
ADD axle6-2 3706 red
ADD beam3x0-1 33299a black
