STEP 17
ADD beam3-1 32523 white
ADD beam3-2 32523 white
ADD pin-32 2780 black
ADD pin-33 2780 black
ADD beam13-2 41239 white
CONNECT beam3x0-1.pin1 -> beam3-1.hole3 STIFF
CONNECT pin-31.pin1 -> beam3-1.hole1 TURNS
CONNECT pin-32.pin2 -> beam3-2.hole2 STIFF
CONNECT pin-33.pin2 -> beam3-2.hole3 STIFF
CONNECT beam3x0-2.pin1 -> beam3-2.hole1 STIFF
CONNECT pin-32.pin1 -> beam13-2.hole2 STIFF
CONNECT pin-33.pin1 -> beam13-2.hole3 STIFF
